\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  I will leave my sinful actions\cf0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And be with my father and Lord
\par My God himself shall be my guide
\par and lead me on the righteous path
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  The might of your holy spirit
\par shall make my heart so fresh and new
\par forgive us now all of our sins.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.   Where can I even run to hide
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj And go out of this troubles.
\par I walk on the plains of Sinai.
\par  O, shine O morning rising sun.
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj And lead me now from shore to shore,
\par  Come over, mountains, cover me,
\par  And let me go away from God.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. I will be with you, my Jesus,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And in your open wounds I find;
\par I feel within me sanctified
\par Until my last day on this earth.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par O, Yes, Jesus the son of God.
\par Has carried all my sins away
\par put on the cross that he was slain.
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  That also from today onward;
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0\qj I pray no longer stay in sin.
\par And put before me righteousness,
\par And tramples it beneath my feet.
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0\qj My God give me the strength I need
\par to fight and be victorious
\par Until I leave this earth at last.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

